Keeper OS @VERSION@: offer of source code
===========================================

This profile builds Keeper OS from Debian 13 (trixie). The package list is
keeper-os-@VERSION@.packages.txt. Copyright and licence notices are kept under
/usr/share/doc/<package>/copyright inside the image.

The snapshot archive has the corresponding source for its packages:

  https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian/@SNAPSHOT@/
  https://snapshot.debian.org/archive/debian-security/@SNAPSHOT@/

Add the same release, updates and security suites as deb-src entries and use
apt-get source <package>=<version> to retrieve the source for a specific package.

The pinned downloads are recorded in tools/build-image:

  VSCodium @CODIUM_VERSION@ (MIT), https://github.com/VSCodium/vscodium
  clangd extension (MIT), https://open-vsx.org/extension/llvm-vs-code-extensions/vscode-clangd
  Firefox @FIREFOX_VERSION@ (MPL 2.0 and others), https://hg.mozilla.org/mozilla-central/
  Kotlin compiler (Apache 2.0), https://github.com/JetBrains/kotlin/

Keeper OS code and build scripts (Apache 2.0):

  https://github.com/contest-keeper/ck-os

For at least three years after you receive this image, we will provide the complete
corresponding source for the GPL or LGPL programs in it on request, on a medium
customarily used for software exchange, for no more than the cost of doing so.
Open a request at https://github.com/contest-keeper/ck-os/issues and include the
image version (@VERSION@) and the program.
